                                      <string>Both models transcribe approved speech/mixed clips and unresolved spans that may contain speech. The Segmentation column tracks boundary approval separately from transcript agreement. Two nonempty transcripts with normalized CER ≤ 2% are accepted. Otherwise, listen and choose or edit within the word limit. More edits mark the transcript difficult. The limit is 3 edits, plus 1 for every full 5 seconds beyond 15 seconds on unresolved spans. Model agreement is not verified transcription accuracy.</string>
